      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Stanford Bachata & Zouk Club: Fall Transition & Leadership Roster 💃🕺",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00003",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 117,
      "endIndex": 543,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Hey everyone! As many of you know, this is going to be my last quarter at Stanford. I’ve enjoyed teaching and organizing Bachata and Zouk classes over the years and I hope that they will continue after I graduate for many years to come. Outside of classes and conferences and research, this club has been a very fulfilling experience, not just for dance, but because of all the people I had a chance to meet and  get to know.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00004",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 543,
      "endIndex": 722,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As we prep for the upcoming academic year, we are transitioning leadership and setting up our official Stanford ASSU/OSE club roster for studio space, funding, and campus events.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00005",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 722,
      "endIndex": 951,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "If you are an enrolled Stanford student (Undergrad, Grad, or Postdoc): Please take 60 seconds to fill out this quick form so we can confirm our official student base and identify our next leadership board:  [Link to Google Form]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00006",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 951,
      "endIndex": 1153,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "(Note: Community members and alumni are always welcome at our socials and open practices, but only matriculated Stanford students can serve as official ASSU officers and secure university space/grants)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00007",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1153,
      "endIndex": 1391,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "If you love these dances and want real leadership/management experience running socials, bringing in guest instructors, and managing club funding, check out the officer section in the form. Let’s keep Zouk and Bachata thriving on campus!",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
