      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4) Leadership recruiting: Direct conversations with potential leaders based on personality and active participation in the club. Time commitment is limited: a few hours at the start of each quarter to reserve rooms, organize teachers. Weekly email post (plus IG and WhatsApp as needed). Need to cultivate next generation of leaders on an ongoing basis (i.e. every year).",
