      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Leila explained that the tango club receives its annual grant from ASSU but learned two years ago that accepting outside donations directly from community members must go through the university. She mentioned that two dance groups were previously penalized for allowing non-Stanford students to pay for lessons, leading to stricter enforcement of university policies. ",
