      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Leila discussed the financial aspects, including the need for a financial officer to apply for grants and the costs of paying instructors, with recent sessions costing around $2,000 total. Leila outlined the leadership structure and recruitment process, noting that the leadership team's time commitment varies but typically involves 3 hours of work at the beginning of each quarter followed by attending regular lessons. She also mentioned upcoming workshops with an Italian instructor and the implementation of an RSVP system for these events.",
